# 1. PRODUCT VISION

Freelance Hub is a two-sided marketplace that connects companies with freelancers.

Companies can publish projects, review applicants, hire freelancers, manage contracts and milestones, evaluate submitted work, and record simulated payments.

Freelancers can create professional profiles, discover projects, submit applications, manage active contracts, submit deliverables, monitor progress, and view earnings and payment records.

The platform must have two distinct experiences:

1. Freelancer workspace
2. Company workspace

Each role must have its own authentication flow, profile, dashboard, navigation, permissions, and workflows.

The application must look like a polished commercial SaaS product that could be demonstrated to faculty, recruiters, or project evaluators.

Product name: Freelance Hub

Product tagline: Find Talent. Build Great Work.

Primary goal: Deliver a working end-to-end freelance marketplace with persistent data and a professional interface.

Secondary goal: Keep the architecture maintainable so additional features can be added later.

